WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.700
AEON draws mathematical forms, live in your browser.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:13.700
Click to zoom in. Right-click to zoom out.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:20.700
Drag to move. Scroll to zoom.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:28.700
Press / to find another form.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:35.700
Change the colors with one click.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:43.700
The Inspector holds every setting for the form on screen.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:51.700
Press E to save an image or a video.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:59.700
Press ? for every shortcut, or take a guided tour.
